<title>SINGAPORE: Osprey seeks arbitration with OMI Promise.</title>
<headline>Osprey seeks arbitration with OMI Promise.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osprey Maritime Ltd said on Friday it had initiated an arbitration against OMI Promise Tankers Inc for failing to deliver a vessel.</p>
<p>Under the original sales terms, OMI Promise Tankers was expected to deliver &quot;Osprey Promise&quot;, re-manmed Kartika Ayu to Osprey Maritime.</p>
<p>No further details were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
